name knuth-pdf
category Package
revision 62969
shortdesc PDF collection of typeset C/WEB sources in TeX Live
longdesc Here you find a large collection of PDF documents for many
longdesc C/WEB programs in TeX Live, both in their original form as
longdesc written by their respective authors, and in the changed form as
longdesc they are actually used in the TeX Live system. Care has been
longdesc taken to keep the section numbering intact, so that you can
longdesc study the sources and their changes in parallel. Also included
longdesc is the collection of "errata" for Donald Knuth's "Computers &
longdesc Typesetting series". Although not all the texts here are
longdesc written or maintained by Donald Knuth, it is more convenient
longdesc for everything to be collected in one place for reading and
longdesc searching. They all stem from the system that Knuth created.
longdesc The central entry point is the "index" file, with links to the
longdesc individual documents, either in HTML or in PDF format.
